    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced46d3ccb952ba68dba5c8a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拂晓的城市染上了「恒星」的光芒，\r\n既「静谧」又令人「心跳加速」。\r\n让我有种即将迎接崭新开始的预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492b575393f30c313b566e6a5922ebb0dd115555f2b2b54521abdd21f7681953",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311a6f1857db64516e5a806e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对AM的营养补充没有特别讲究。\r\n吃谷物或谷物加工食品都无所谓。\r\n但是一定要有「豆腐味噌汤」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed5d76323ce0e8fd10095fe754540a87d6a85383aede7ed1500d19eded6bca5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641b7fe6882616fbfa8ea4c6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的目标是……\r\n每天跟「同学」进行「对话」。\r\n目前进度……该「急起直追」了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04c0b49fc6cb361fece938c49af5e6acda458e88e70709eb0b8ee3a5bea9e751",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1cec0e4f45a8c6a6d23a55",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把「纪录媒体」缴交给老师……\r\n收到回复「难懂、无法解读」……\r\n写出「好懂的笔记」真不容易呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a1315d6b1dac448cd25399727d2e17914ccb1705450ab2d456864ac2984df47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d7d0b7eb6c09ea0f2fc9e0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好热闹……听得见多达100垓的\r\n声音喔。他们在宣示自己的存在，\r\n让我知道自己不是一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d092d37435a78627c6bdf3729882652981d15841b187f5b6affe1de5b59a24be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79281cae5a2cd8867df20590",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员还在执行「任务」吗？\r\n……与你「同行」会比较好吗？\r\n在漆黑的宇宙中会感到「寂寞」吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d95a701b35119f604f26858b4012bd018f4374dc0edababdcf9d15b3b20fe20e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3b94c16a3950166eec5e2e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "解除「人工冬眠」。\r\n生命开始活动的季节到来了。\r\n「我」该从什么开始做起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2e4bb30cd34fde26ba2b666d042f01496ce10b6dcd9ae84f5c9ed943c7d046",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b9a000478aec8ddc27410b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你感到「炎热」了吗？\r\n那就与我「同行」吧。\r\n夜晚观测星星很「凉爽」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0260b46d39860cfec4a4c18605d385a285506997c807304aebf1cbc82618d77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751e60d3806c1bebca34fe40",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众人一起食用「月亮」的季节……\r\n新宇宙也「喜欢」。加了蛋黄的\r\n荞麦面、赏月汉堡、赏月团子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7092aa59de04977bf21862b258e02b85a930f8ba6749199b956dce24b97dc30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec61c6b192342b892f387ac6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真想快点变得「温暖」……\r\n「INTI」……把指尖放到\r\n训练员的口袋里「避难」……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0e3180d998457436417a7ee2f1e7c9c0662304bd457c66973834207599d250",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b91a616036160e60d67fcb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『三つ編み』…毎朝のミッション。\r\n――“NPB”、ゼンノロブロイに\r\n構築法…『教わる』したから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0efe703794b75a6daf4b1f4905b9d2ed942fc89193ab65da74108cec2d0d7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa777abd10ffd7d3f286af7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“アップクォーク”。\r\n証左に、今朝は“イオンテイル”\r\n…わかる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6fc4f8085588e84f4d795e7b0ce9d70c5c9e308e70778ea6df9b88dfbf90e7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "90011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/90011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29067a886b069fa9b1b84a96",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "効率的太陽光享受法を…\r\nラインクラフトからラーニング。\r\nトレーナー…『ポカポカ』、試す？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c6ea1a946034c80dfe73b6316d8be86025922eb126776ce1aeb57861534804",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
