    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60f1e35f445a5cd470ccffc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『お疲れさま』だね…――鞄に\r\n…『甘蕉』、“保持”…“GIVU”\r\n『元気でる』のフレーバーだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114e99dc2a4176e79a6b6406f373dcd72bdb349fd9449bf65f6c2efec365537a",
