    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa74befe57cb4da0d33fac5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“飛行物体”、“確認”したら…\r\n『天道虫』だった――\r\nふふ、『のどけし』だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13cb6b25396902b5ec9818394509969bcdb6285477266a9b4f890fb8d357f4de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
