    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d924837ad70413575fbc4be3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "水分の“補給”は“QOAX”…！\r\n『檸檬』“三日月”にするといい…\r\nビタミンCも、摂取可能になるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4759bba57e47158f92737cd4504040f98a25f0b14fd7132cc6697236291ccc7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
