    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea9c04afaedcdc570380e3c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄很「热爱」恒星的故事。\r\n但她也一样既炙热又明亮，\r\n是颗相当出色的「恒星」喔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ca56e93b74051c89c02bc9af4614bcbc1d80249d7221aac33b0a0165a14dd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3860dba6f0754f2e4266dc6c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我偶然……与荣进闪耀同时吃午餐。\r\n甚至一样都吃「纳豆定食」……\r\n呵呵，真是奇迹般的「接触」呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f4719b90a814f5746a6f320582f42d75b25231d4ae90cb4b5f589c3e33857b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320845f124dc705c0566caab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬正在与某人「通讯」。\r\n那「声音」既温柔又哀伤。\r\n……希望她能获得「安宁」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b144701f9d013bc0b918b51ad9b6435b0aa694c123e233fbf1c527d458460719",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e27432a793e5f24fefce6296",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽☆美丽～★☆\r\n为什么她就能引发UAP呢？\r\n我跟她有何不同……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d810ec4608d46c222d9a6e706b5d79b263948c5c713a36b3b11b91278b7cb02c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c388fa3ae9732521de289b5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道说新宇宙是「微中子」吗……？\r\n贯穿了自动门的传感器……\r\n导致门没开……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1537390db6f14eceda1053841e368a76e4a90f923607c5ae0b0309541d2e6920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
