        "1105",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599d0b4965f624943002911e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这套服装简称SF……有点不可思议？\r\n或许真是如此。毕竟穿上后会让我\r\n感到「雀跃」，真是不可思议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179dd116e105891319d75ca14d14bcd1454020a72e7508ead2a41e227ad610aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68815fc40e9c3aa129681a11",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像彗星一样。拖着尾巴向前飞奔。\r\n在舞台上留下轨迹，绽放光芒。\r\n尽管有些相遇此生只会有一次……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3896663d2442eceba7504f695d0a041a82def48bad09a66d80e319cf49e9960",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d54cb614967fbf65e35724f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "服装的设计灵感来自太空飞行员喔。\r\n纵然得以「对话」的存在身处\r\n辽阔的宇宙，我也要前去见面……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a5af19c24da5eeb0a4c48ad32d8c6ba7b990da51e659217f07fc24f5154787",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09d20c02eb395cef0172b80f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过计算，这内搭跟外套都是\r\n最佳设计。至于为何要发光……\r\n算是为了容易「被找到」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f09ee191203203db83ec2afe85874007fd6fa901f59f8d7391c760c29b3d790",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea6e3b2cf3bcc02741ffba7c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "否定……感到「昏昏沉沉」。\r\n氧气供应不……呼啊～啊。\r\n……失礼了。刚刚「补充」完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9feac70767c3852490e88fdff47e9cba1415948e19a3823ee2e6ed5d5326b72b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1efdfcb08f595fe101d54769",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "调理包、便携食品、果冻饮料。\r\n发明者真「伟大」。高效率。\r\n我老是「嘴馋」，帮了我很大的忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8229fad99b7714c22b1c3b353dcb17d4aa718a677cf7d5f3353ca2ae11eb650c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
