        "1105",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f67ad849dd0a49c6933202",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小腿肚遭受攻击……\r\n这生物虽微小却很棘手呢。\r\n「蚊音」……在哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde085bc21190f53cc76dbce166f40ae0d56241a72de706e4057622dbffb9c81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b109e972aee664400f87ebbc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧急状况，确认烟雾产生。\r\n准备「升空」──我想去拿\r\n那个「热呼呼」的东西……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69dbc15f25af98ea19a15d801a7c259716aa2751706bc1def2e912d3ee11e66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1105/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dfb5674990369770fdd64a6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独自一人走在寒冷的夜里。\r\n四下无人，一片「寂静」。\r\n与航海家、隼鸟号……「对频」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb54e441af27878f97c858fbf00a18d03419268ace50a7efd05407faee09ef33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
