    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f9901f4284ce70d3f6f3971",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『お団子』…ネオユニヴァースは\r\n豆腐を適用する『レシピ』採択を、\r\n強く、強く推奨――だよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65809b25246898c12951700c5759c18002a3ef87717f1826a462ef16b67641b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
