      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鼻孔に“SMOK”――パターン、\r\nフジキセキが“推薦”の“YKMY”\r\n“リフトオフ”して確保、だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f63792849501402ae86aacf717534e0ef27b3ebbdf108cf128fd00484c1c9d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
