      "uid": "zhcn:1f4b0f6ac65d027147f85ea7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你刚刚……「看见」了吗？\r\n是我多心了吗……如果我叫它的话，\r\n是否会再出现？呼叫～呼叫～",
      "source_fingerprint": "baea61695e55547b87416325d12fd3be4ba1caddf0fa8c64afcfd60e8fa6c881",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
